#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:2
msgid "研究技能"
msgstr "Research Skills"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:24
msgid "选择技能入口"
msgstr "Choose a skill entry point"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:26
msgid "**推进文献、假设、实验和分析**：在插件技能管理的 **Claude** 标签页，将研究助手技能同步到工作区，再交给 Claude Code / Codex 使用。"
msgstr ""
"**Work on literature, hypotheses, experiments, and analysis**: Sync research "
"assistant skills to the workspace from the **Claude** tab in the extension, then use "
"them with Claude Code / Codex."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:28
msgid "**连接外部工具或安装第三方技能**：使用 **MCP**、**市场** 标签页，配置对应的服务与来源。"
msgstr ""
"**Connect external tools or install third-party skills**: Configure services and "
"sources in the **MCP** and **Marketplace** tabs."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:31
msgid "研究助手技能"
msgstr "Research assistant skills"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:33
msgid "研究工作流主要通过 Claude Code 的“skills-first”方式提供："
msgstr ""
"Research workflows are primarily provided through Claude Code’s “skills-first” "
"approach:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:35
msgid "AgentSociety 内置研究 skills：随 VSCode 插件打包，在技能管理页查看并同步到工作区。"
msgstr ""
"Built-in AgentSociety research skills are bundled with the VS Code extension. Browse "
"and sync them to the workspace from the skill management page."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:36
msgid "Agent 运行时技能：由后端 ``/api/v1/agent-skills/*`` 发现、扫描和导入，供仿真参与者按需激活；不是研究助手的 Claude 技能。"
msgstr ""
"Agent runtime skills are discovered, scanned and imported through ``/api/v1/agent-"
"skills/*`` for simulation participants to activate as needed. They are separate from "
"the research assistant's Claude skills."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:38
msgid "**agentsociety-literature-search** - 学术文献检索"
msgstr "**agentsociety-literature-search** - Literature search"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:39
msgid "**agentsociety-hypothesis** - 假设管理（add, get, list, delete）"
msgstr "**agentsociety-hypothesis** - Assumption management (add, get, list, delete)"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:40
msgid "**agentsociety-experiment-config** - 实验配置生成与验证"
msgstr ""
"**agentsociety-experiment-config** - Experimental configuration generation and "
"verification"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:41
msgid "**agentsociety-run-experiment** - 实验执行与监控"
msgstr "**agentsociety-run-experiment** - Experiment execution and monitoring"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:42
msgid "**agentsociety-analysis** - 数据分析与跨实验综合"
msgstr "**agentsociety-analysis** - Data analysis and cross-experimental synthesis"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:43
msgid "**agentsociety-create-agent** - 自定义 Agent 生成与校验"
msgstr "**agentsociety-create-agent** - Custom Agent generation and verification"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:44
msgid "**agentsociety-create-env-module** - 自定义环境模块生成与校验"
msgstr "**agentsociety-create-env-module** - Generate and validate custom environment modules"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:45
msgid "**agentsociety-use-dataset / agentsociety-create-dataset** - 使用或整理研究数据集"
msgstr ""
"**agentsociety-use-dataset / agentsociety-create-dataset** - Use or prepare research "
"datasets"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:46
msgid "**agentsociety-research-pipeline** - 按研究阶段组织任务与产物"
msgstr "**agentsociety-research-pipeline** - Organize tasks and artifacts by research phase"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:47
msgid "**paper-toolkit** - 独立论文写作工具链入口"
msgstr "**paper-toolkit** - entry point of the standalone paper writing toolchain"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:51
msgid ""
"本页中的 ``.agentsociety/bin/ags.py`` 命令面向**已初始化的工作区**。运行这些命令还需要将对应研究技能同步到 ``.claude/skills/``，并使用已安装"
" SDK 的 Python 环境。如果当前目录尚未生成 ``.agentsociety/``，请先执行："
msgstr ""
"The ``.agentsociety/bin/ags.py`` commands on this page require an **initialized workspace**. Sync"
" the corresponding research skills to ``.claude/skills/`` and use a Python environment containing"
" the SDK. If the current directory does not yet contain ``.agentsociety/``, run:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:53
msgid "agentsociety-workspace init --target-dir ."
msgstr "agentsociety-workspace init --target-dir ."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:58
msgid "等价入口是 ``python -m agentsociety2.society.workspace init --target-dir .``。"
msgstr ""
"An equivalent entry point is ``python -m agentsociety2.society.workspace init "
"--target-dir .``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:61
msgid "create-agent 技能"
msgstr "create-agent skill"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:63
msgid ""
"``agentsociety-create-agent`` 用于创建或修订工作区里的自定义 Agent 类型。它不是 PersonAgent "
"内置认知技能，而是研究工作流中的开发辅助 skill：当实验需要一个当前不存在的 Agent class 时，通常由 ``agentsociety-experiment-"
"config`` 分支调用。"
msgstr ""
"``agentsociety-create-agent`` Used to create or revise custom Agent types in the "
"workspace. It is not a built-in cognitive skill of PersonAgent, but a development "
"auxiliary skill in the research workflow: when the experiment requires an Agent class"
" that does not currently exist, it is usually called by the ``agentsociety-"
"experiment-config`` branch."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:65
msgid "**文件位置与扫描规则**:"
msgstr "**File location and scan rules**:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:67
msgid "新 Agent 模块应放在 ``custom/agents/`` 下，例如 ``custom/agents/research/lab_agent.py``。"
msgstr ""
"New Agent modules should be placed under ``custom/agents/``, for example "
"``custom/agents/research/lab_agent.py``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:68
msgid "扫描器会读取该目录下的 ``*.py``，但跳过路径片段包含 ``examples/`` 的文件。"
msgstr ""
"The scanner reads ``*.py`` in this directory, but skips files whose path fragment "
"contains ``examples/``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:69
msgid "推荐一个文件一个主要 Agent class；一个文件中存在多个 ``AgentBase`` 子类时，扫描器也能发现。"
msgstr ""
"It is recommended to have one main Agent class per file; when there are multiple "
"``AgentBase`` subclasses in a file, the scanner can also find it."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:71
msgid "**基类选择**:"
msgstr "**Base class selection**:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:77
msgid "基类"
msgstr "Base class"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:78
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Applicable scenarios"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:79
msgid "``AgentBase``"
msgstr "``AgentBase``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:80
msgid "简单实验、博弈/基准场景，开发者自行管理状态。"
msgstr ""
"Simple experiments, games/benchmark scenarios, developers manage the status by "
"themselves."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:81
msgid "``PersonAgent``"
msgstr "``PersonAgent``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:84
msgid "**本地校验**:"
msgstr "**Local validation**:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:85
msgid ""
"agentsociety-workspace init --target-dir .\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py --json"
msgstr ""
"agentsociety-workspace init --target-dir .\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py --json"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:92
msgid "以下命令使用已安装 ``agentsociety2`` 的 Python 环境；若工作区配置了独立解释器，请用该解释器替换 ``python``。"
msgstr ""
"Use a Python environment with ``agentsociety2`` installed. Replace ``python`` with "
"the workspace interpreter when using a separate environment."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:98
msgid "实验工作流"
msgstr "Experiment workflow"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:100
msgid "研究 pipeline 的主干是："
msgstr "The backbone of the research pipeline is:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:102
msgid ""
"``literature-search → hypothesis → experiment-config → run-experiment → analysis → "
"paper-toolkit``"
msgstr ""
"``literature-search → hypothesis → experiment-config → run-experiment → analysis → "
"paper-toolkit``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:104
msgid "实验相关的两个核心 skill 是："
msgstr "The two core skills related to experiments are:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:110
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "Skill"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:111
msgid "主要输入"
msgstr "Main input"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:112
msgid "主要输出"
msgstr "Main output"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:113
msgid "``agentsociety-experiment-config``"
msgstr "``agentsociety-experiment-config``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:114
msgid "``SIM_SETTINGS.json``、已有 Agent/Env/Dataset 信息"
msgstr "``SIM_SETTINGS.json``, existing Agent/Env/Dataset information"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:115
msgid "``init_config.json``、``steps.yaml``、``config_params.py``"
msgstr "``init_config.json``、``steps.yaml``、``config_params.py``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:116
msgid "``agentsociety-run-experiment``"
msgstr "``agentsociety-run-experiment``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:117
msgid "``init_config.json`` + ``steps.yaml``"
msgstr "``init_config.json`` + ``steps.yaml``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:118
msgid "``run/replay/``、日志、artifacts、``pid.json``"
msgstr "``run/replay/``, logs, artifacts, and ``pid.json``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:120
#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:136
msgid "推荐流程："
msgstr "Recommended process:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:122
msgid "先确认工作区中已经具备 ``init_config.json``、``steps.yaml`` 与所需模块信息。"
msgstr ""
"First confirm that the workspace already contains ``init_config.json``, "
"``steps.yaml``, and the required module information."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:123
msgid "在 ``experiment-config`` 阶段先扫描模块；如果缺少 Agent 或 Env，先补充对应自定义模块，再重新扫描。"
msgstr ""
"During the ``experiment-config`` stage, scan modules first. If an Agent or "
"environment module is missing, add the corresponding custom module and then scan "
"again."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:124
msgid "运行 ``experiment-config check`` 或等价校验，确认配置和步骤文件可用。"
msgstr ""
"Run ``experiment-config check`` or equivalent verification to confirm that the "
"configuration and step files are available."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:125
msgid "启动实验时使用 ``run-experiment``；后台执行必须指定日志文件，避免丢失 verbose 输出。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``run-experiment`` when starting the experiment; a log file must be specified for"
" background execution to avoid losing verbose output."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:126
msgid "实验完成后检查 ``run/replay/_schema.json``、日志与 artifacts，再进入分析阶段。"
msgstr ""
"After the experiment is completed, check ``run/replay/_schema.json``, logs, and "
"artifacts before entering the analysis phase."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:130
msgid "分析工作流"
msgstr "Analysis workflow"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:131
msgid ""
"``agentsociety-analysis`` 面向已完成实验的数据解释、图表和报告生成。当前 replay 数据位于 ``run/replay/``，可通过 "
"``ReplayReader`` / DuckDB 读取；如果 ``_schema.json`` 不存在，应回到 ``run-experiment`` 或配置修复阶段。"
msgstr ""
"``agentsociety-analysis`` handles data interpretation, charts, and report generation for "
"completed experiments. Replay data lives in ``run/replay/`` and can be read through "
"``ReplayReader`` / DuckDB. If ``_schema.json`` does not exist, return to ``run-experiment`` or "
"the configuration repair phase."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:138
msgid "**加载上下文**：读取 hypothesis、experiment config、steps 和 run 元数据。"
msgstr "**Load context**: Read hypothesis, experiment config, steps, and run metadata."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:139
msgid "**确认问题**：明确本次分析是验证假设、解释异常、比较组间差异，还是生成报告。"
msgstr ""
"**Clarify the question**: Clarify whether this analysis is to test hypotheses, "
"explain anomalies, compare differences between groups, or generate a report."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:140
msgid "**探索数据**：列出 replay dataset，查看 schema、行数、关键字段和缺失情况。"
msgstr ""
"**Explore data**: List replay datasets and view the schema, number of rows, key "
"fields, and missing values."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:141
msgid "**提出发现**：先给出可检验发现，再决定需要哪些图表。"
msgstr ""
"**Propose findings**: Present testable findings first, then decide which charts are "
"needed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:142
msgid "**生成图表**：单实验默认最多 5 张图；每张图在报告中必须有一句说明。"
msgstr ""
"**Generate charts**: A single experiment can have up to 5 charts by default; each "
"chart must have a corresponding explanation in the report."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**写报告**：单实验输出到 ``presentation/hypothesis_{id}/``，跨实验综合输出到 ``synthesis/``。"
msgstr ""
"**Write report**: Single-experiment output goes to ``presentation/hypothesis_{id}/``,"
" and cross-experiment synthesis output goes to ``synthesis/``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:145
msgid ""
"报告与状态目录约定：用户可见报告写在 ``presentation/`` 与 ``synthesis/``；harness 机器状态在 "
"``.agentsociety/analysis/``；不要在 ``presentation/`` 下再建旧式 ``analysis/`` 目录。"
msgstr ""
"Report and state paths: user-facing reports go under ``presentation/`` and "
"``synthesis/``; harness machine state lives under ``.agentsociety/analysis/``; do not"
" recreate a legacy ``analysis/`` tree under ``presentation/``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:147
msgid "常用命令："
msgstr "Commonly used commands:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:147
msgid ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py analysis load-context --workspace . --hypothesis-id 1 "
"--experiment-id 1\n"
"python - <<'PY'\n"
"from agentsociety2.storage import ReplayReader\n"
"reader = ReplayReader(\"hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/replay\")\n"
"for dataset in reader.load_dataset_catalog():\n"
"    print(dataset[\"dataset_id\"], dataset[\"table_name\"])\n"
"reader.close()\n"
"PY"
msgstr ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py analysis load-context --workspace . --hypothesis-id 1 "
"--experiment-id 1\n"
"python - <<'PY'\n"
"from agentsociety2.storage import ReplayReader\n"
"reader = ReplayReader(\"hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/replay\")\n"
"for dataset in reader.load_dataset_catalog():\n"
"    print(dataset[\"dataset_id\"], dataset[\"table_name\"])\n"
"reader.close()\n"
"PY"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:162
msgid "学术文献检索"
msgstr "Literature search service"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:164
msgid ""
"``agentsociety-literature-search`` 通过统一的远程检索服务收集学术文献，并把结果保存到工作区 ``papers/`` "
"目录。默认检索所有已配置数据源：``local``、``arxiv``、``crossref``、``openalex``。"
msgstr ""
"``agentsociety-literature-search`` Collect academic literature through a unified "
"remote search service and save the results to the workspace ``papers/`` directory. "
"All configured data sources are retrieved by default: ``local``, ``arxiv``, "
"``crossref``, ``openalex``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:166
msgid "配置项："
msgstr "Configuration:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:166
#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:271
msgid ""
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL=https://llmapi.fiblab.net/mcp/\n"
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your-literature-search-key"
msgstr ""
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL=https://llmapi.fiblab.net/mcp/\n"
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your-literature-search-key"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:173
msgid "搜索命令示例："
msgstr "Search command example:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:173
msgid ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"agent-based modeling social networks\"\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"urban mobility simulation LLM agents\" "
"--year-from 2020 --year-to 2026 --multi-query"
msgstr ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"agent-based modeling social networks\"\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"urban mobility simulation LLM agents\" "
"--year-from 2020 --year-to 2026 --multi-query"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:180
msgid "输出约定："
msgstr "Output convention:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:182
msgid "``papers/literature_index.json`` 是稳定索引，记录标题、作者、年份、来源、query、分数和本地 ``file_path``。"
msgstr ""
"``papers/literature_index.json`` is a stable index, recording title, author, year, "
"source, query, score and local ``file_path``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:183
msgid ""
"每篇文献保存为 ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``，这是后续 hypothesis、analysis 与外部 ``paper-"
"toolkit`` 写作流程引用的主要本地笔记。"
msgstr ""
"Each document is saved as ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``, which is the main local "
"note cited by subsequent hypothesis, analysis, and the external ``paper-toolkit`` "
"writing workflow."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:184
msgid ""
"检索完成后会自动尝试下载开放获取 PDF 到 ``papers/full_texts/``，路径写入 "
"``extra_fields.full_text.file_path``；不要把索引中的 ``file_path`` 从 Markdown 笔记替换成 PDF。"
msgstr ""
"If the original PDF is to be downloaded, it should be placed in "
"``papers/full_texts/`` and recorded in ``extra_fields.full_text.file_path``; do not "
"replace ``file_path`` in the index from Markdown notes to PDF."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:185
msgid "文献检索不会自动绕过出版商权限。PDF 下载只处理开放获取或用户授权的文件；没有开放 PDF 时，可以补充本地 Markdown 笔记并记录来源。"
msgstr ""
"Literature search does not bypass publisher access controls. PDF downloads only "
"process open-access or user-authorized files. If no open PDF is available, local "
"Markdown notes may be added together with the recorded source."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:193
msgid "文献技能 (literature)"
msgstr "Literature Skill"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:193
msgid ""
"文献技能通过 **MCP 协议** 连接学术文献检索网关，使用工作区 ``.env`` 中的 ``LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL`` 和 "
"``LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY``（无需单独配置 Claude ``mcp.json``）。网关上的其他 MCP 工具不会被文献技能调用。推荐优先使用 "
"``search_literature_and_save``，而不是直接调用底层 ``search_literature``：前者会把检索结果落到工作区中，确保后续 Agent、Claude "
"Code 和论文写作技能都能通过本地文件继续引用这些文献。"
msgstr ""
"The literature skill connects to the academic literature search gateway through the **MCP "
"protocol**, using ``LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL`` and ``LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY`` from the "
"workspace ``.env`` (no separate Claude ``mcp.json`` configuration needed). Other MCP tools on the"
" gateway are not called by the literature skill. It is recommended to use "
"``search_literature_and_save`` instead of calling the underlying ``search_literature`` directly: "
"the former will drop the search results into the workspace, ensuring that subsequent Agents, "
"Claude Code and paper writing skills can continue to reference these documents through local "
"files."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:198
msgid ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.literature import search_literature_and_save, load_literature_index\n"
"\n"
"# 搜索并保存文献（默认 10 篇、已配置数据源，并更新 papers/literature_index.json）\n"
"result = await search_literature_and_save(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    query=\"agent-based modeling social networks\",\n"
"    year_from=2020,      # 可选：年份筛选\n"
"    year_to=2024,\n"
"    enable_multi_query=True,  # 可选：启用多查询模式\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 指定数据源搜索\n"
"await search_literature_and_save(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    query=\"machine learning\",\n"
"    sources=[\"local\", \"arxiv\"],  # 可选：指定数据源\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 加载文献索引\n"
"index = load_literature_index(workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"))"
msgstr ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.literature import search_literature_and_save, load_literature_index\n"
"\n"
"# Search and save literature: defaults to 10 papers, configured sources, and updates "
"papers/literature_index.json\n"
"result = await search_literature_and_save(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    query=\"agent-based modeling social networks\",\n"
"    year_from=2020,      # Optional: filter by publication year\n"
"    year_to=2024,\n"
"    enable_multi_query=True,  # Optional: enable multiple search queries\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# Search selected data sources\n"
"await search_literature_and_save(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    query=\"machine learning\",\n"
"    sources=[\"local\", \"arxiv\"],  # Optional: select data sources\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# Load the literature index\n"
"index = load_literature_index(workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"))"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:226
msgid "**保存结果**:"
msgstr "**Save results**:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:224
msgid ""
"每篇检索结果都会保存为 ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``。这个 Markdown 文件是稳定的本地文献笔记，包含标题、检索词、年份、期刊、 "
"DOI/URL、摘要、作者和相关内容片段。"
msgstr ""
"Each search result will be saved as ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``. This Markdown file is a "
"stable local literature note that contains title, search terms, year, journal, DOI/URL, abstract,"
" author, and related content fragments."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:231
msgid ""
"``papers/literature_index.json`` 会同步更新。索引中的 ``file_path`` 指向本地 Markdown 文献笔记，因此插件中的 "
"``@引用`` 可以复制为 ``@papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``，供 Claude Code 或 Agent 读取。"
msgstr ""
"``papers/literature_index.json`` will be updated simultaneously. ``file_path`` in the"
" index points to the local Markdown literature note, so the ``@cite`` button in the "
"plug-in can be copied as ``@papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md`` for Claude Code or Agent "
"to read."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:234
msgid "重复运行检索时会生成新的本地文献笔记，并追加到索引中，便于保留不同检索轮次的上下文。"
msgstr ""
"When a search is run repeatedly, new local literature notes are generated and "
"appended to the index, allowing context to be retained across different search "
"rounds."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:236
msgid "**原文下载（由 Claude/Agent 按需执行）**:"
msgstr "**Full-text download (on demand by Claude/Agent)**:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:238
msgid ""
"``search_literature_and_save`` 默认会尝试下载开放获取的原文，可用 ``download_full_text=False`` "
"关闭；下载失败不会把元数据笔记替换成错误文件。检索结果会尽量保留 "
"``doi``、``url``、``pdf_url``、``full_text_url``、``download_url``、 "
"``open_access``、``best_oa_location`` 等元信息；Claude Code 或 Agent 可以基于这些线索按需下载开放获取原文。"
msgstr ""
"``search_literature_and_save`` attempts open-access downloads by default; set "
"``download_full_text=False`` to disable them. Failed downloads do not replace "
"metadata notes with error files. Results retain metadata such as ``doi``, ``url``, "
"``pdf_url``, ``full_text_url``, ``download_url``, ``open_access`` and "
"``best_oa_location``; Claude Code or an agent can use these to obtain open-access "
"full text as needed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:243
msgid "建议的下载约定："
msgstr "Recommended download conventions:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:245
msgid "原文 PDF 放在 ``papers/full_texts/*.pdf``。"
msgstr "The original PDF is located at ``papers/full_texts/*.pdf``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:246
msgid "优先使用 API 返回的 PDF 直链；arXiv 论文可从 ``/abs/<id>`` 转为 ``https://arxiv.org/pdf/<id>.pdf``。"
msgstr ""
"Priority is given to PDF direct links returned by the API; arXiv papers can be "
"converted from ``/abs/<id>`` to ``https://arxiv.org/pdf/<id>.pdf``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:248
msgid "DOI 仅作为落地页线索，不保证能直接得到 PDF；如果需要下载，应确认最终响应确实是 PDF。"
msgstr ""
"The DOI is only used as a landing page clue, and there is no guarantee that the PDF "
"will be obtained directly; if you need to download it, you should confirm that the "
"final response is indeed a PDF."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:249
msgid "下载完成后，可在对应索引条目的 ``extra_fields[\"full_text\"]`` 中记录:"
msgstr ""
"After the download is completed, it can be recorded in "
"``extra_fields[\"full_text\"]`` of the corresponding index entry:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:246
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"status\": \"downloaded\",\n"
"  \"file_path\": \"papers/full_texts/example.pdf\",\n"
"  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2401.01234.pdf\"\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"status\": \"downloaded\",\n"
"  \"file_path\": \"papers/full_texts/example.pdf\",\n"
"  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2401.01234.pdf\"\n"
"}"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:259
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"如果没有找到开放原文，也可以记录 ``{\"status\": \"no_candidate\"}`` 或 ``{\"status\": \"failed\", "
"\"reason\": \"...\"}``，便于插件页面显示状态。"
msgstr ""
"If the open original text is not found, you can also record ``{\"status\": "
"\"no_candidate\"}`` or ``{\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"...\"}`` to "
"facilitate the plug-in page to display the status."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:264
msgid ""
"许多 CrossRef/OpenAlex 结果只提供 DOI 或落地页，不一定有开放 PDF。 Claude/Agent 不应绕过出版商权限，也不应把 HTML "
"落地页当作 PDF 保存。"
msgstr ""
"Many CrossRef/OpenAlex results only offer a DOI or landing page, not necessarily an "
"open PDF. Claude/Agent should not bypass publisher permissions or save HTML landing "
"pages as PDFs."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:267
