"Research skills use the same LLM configuration. Different models can be configured "
"for specific skills via environment variables:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:393
msgid ""
"# 默认 LLM\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\"\n"
"\n"
"# 代码生成（实验设计、分析）\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\""
msgstr ""
"# Default LLM\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Code generation for experiment design and analysis\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\""

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:4
msgid "研究技能帮助工作台中的研究助手推进文献检索、假设管理、实验设计、执行和分析。它们通过工作区文件衔接各阶段，便于研究者检查依据、修改配置并复用结果。"
msgstr ""
"Research skills help the workbench assistant search literature, manage hypotheses, design "
"experiments, execute runs and analyze results. They connect stages through workspace files so "
"researchers can inspect evidence, revise configuration and reuse results."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills.rst:6
msgid ""
"研究助手技能由扩展同步到工作区，供 Claude Code / Codex 使用；仿真参与者的行为技能则由 :doc:`/agent_skills` 中的运行时管理。首次研究的完整路径见 "
":doc:`/research_workflow`，输入数据准备见 :doc:`/datasets`。"
msgstr ""
"The extension synchronizes research assistant skills into the workspace for Claude Code / Codex. "
"Simulation participant behavior skills are managed by the runtime described in "
":doc:`/agent_skills`. For the complete research path, see :doc:`/research_workflow`; for input "
"data, see :doc:`/datasets`."

