msgstr "Needs the existing tool-decision loop, skill runtime and persistent memory."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills/workspace.rst:82
msgid ""
"校验器会检查：目标文件为 Python 文件、至少有一个直接继承 ``AgentBase`` 或 ``PersonAgent`` 的类、``ask`` / ``step`` / "
"``to_workspace`` 均为 ``async def``（同时保持继承的 ``create`` / ``from_workspace`` 工作区契约可用）、模块可动态导入、目标类不是 "
"abstract class。创建完成后，在 VS Code 扩展中执行 **Scan Custom Modules** 让后端重新发现模块。"
msgstr ""
"The validator checks that the target is a Python file containing at least one direct "
"``AgentBase`` or ``PersonAgent`` subclass, that ``ask`` / ``step`` / ``to_workspace`` are ``async"
" def`` methods, that the inherited ``create`` / ``from_workspace`` workspace contract remains "
"usable, that the module imports dynamically, and that the class is concrete. Then run **Scan "
"Custom Modules** in the VS Code extension to rediscover the module."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills/workspace.rst:85
msgid "按任务选择辅助技能"
msgstr "Choosing supporting skills by task"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills/workspace.rst:87
msgid ""
"不知道可用的类名或参数时，先用 ``agentsociety-scan-modules``；已有合适模块时直接配置实验。只有模块能力不足，才进入 ``agentsociety-create-"
"agent`` 或 ``agentsociety-create-env-module``，生成后再扫描与验证。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``agentsociety-scan-modules`` first when class names or parameters are unknown. If a suitable"
" module exists, configure the experiment directly. Use ``agentsociety-create-agent`` or "
"``agentsociety-create-env-module`` only when more capability is needed, then scan and validate "
"the generated module."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/skills/workspace.rst:89
msgid ""
"已有稿件时，可用 ``agentsociety-paper-review`` "
"检查论点、证据与呈现方式，输出内部模拟评审和建议。它不会自动改稿、重跑实验或更新研究进度；研究者确认后，再由相应研究技能处理需要回访的阶段。写作与排版继续通过独立的 ``paper-"
"toolkit`` 完成。"
msgstr ""
"For an existing manuscript, ``agentsociety-paper-review`` checks arguments, evidence and "
"presentation, producing an internal mock review and recommendations. It does not revise the "
"manuscript, rerun experiments or update research progress automatically. After researcher "
"approval, the relevant research skill handles any earlier stage that needs revisiting. Writing "
"and typesetting continue through the separate ``paper-toolkit``."
